cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">245</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">eat up, devour</b>, esp. in phrases, <span class=\"gk\">βίοτον καὶ κτήματα, οἶκον, χρήματα ἔ.</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.123</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.431</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">389</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡμέτερον κάματον νήποινον ἔδουσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.417</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> metaph., <span class=\"gk\">καμάτῳ τε καὶ ἄλγεσι θυμὸν ἔδοντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.75</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.379</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.129</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Semon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.24</span> </span> (s.v.l.).</div></div>"}